"旧合并引擎会尝试把两端数据拼在一起，但单端删除的提供商、设置或会话可能被另一端旧数据同步回来。" = "The legacy merge engine tries to combine both sides, but providers, settings, or conversations deleted on only one side may come back from old data on the other side.";
