"内建本地工具" = "Outils locaux intégrés";
"应用内建本地工具服务，无需配置网络地址。" = "Service local intégré à l’app. Aucune adresse réseau n’est requise.";
"内建交互工具" = "Outils d’interaction intégrés";
"内建记忆操作" = "Opérations de mémoire intégrées";
"内建文件操作" = "Opérations de fichiers intégrées";
"内建数据库操作" = "Opérations de base de données intégrées";
"内建自定义工具" = "Outils personnalisés intégrés";
"自定义 JavaScript 工具。脚本保存在应用的 CustomJSTools 独立目录中，执行入口为同步 function main(input)。运行引擎：%@。能力边界：没有 Node.js、require/import、文件系统、原生网络 API 或持久后台任务能力。工具说明：%@" = "Outil JavaScript personnalisé. Les scripts sont stockés dans le dossier CustomJSTools séparé de l’app. Le point d’entrée est la fonction synchrone main(input). Moteur d’exécution : %@. Limites : pas de Node.js, require/import, système de fichiers, API réseau native ni tâche d’arrière-plan persistante. Description de l’outil : %@";

// 内建个人数据 MCP 服务器
"内建个人数据" = "Built-in Personal Data";
"应用内建个人数据服务，无需配置网络地址；HealthKit 与 EventKit 权限仅在工具正式调用时申请。" = "App built-in personal data service. No network address is required; HealthKit and EventKit permissions are requested only when a tool is actually called.";
"提供 HealthKit 健康数据与 EventKit 日历/提醒事项工具。仅在工具正式调用时申请系统权限。" = "Provides HealthKit health data tools and EventKit calendar/reminder tools. System permissions are requested only when a tool is actually called.";
"工具正式调用时按单个 HealthKit 类型申请读取或写入权限。" = "When a tool is called, read or write permission is requested only for the selected HealthKit type.";
"列出当前内建 HealthKit 工具支持的健康数据类型、读写能力与默认单位。不会请求 HealthKit 权限。" = "Lists the health data types, read/write capabilities, and default units supported by the built-in HealthKit tools. Does not request HealthKit permission.";
"按 HealthKit 类型读取原始样本，例如 heart_rate、heart_rate_variability、sleep_analysis、workouts、body_mass。调用时仅请求所需类型的读取权限。" = "Reads raw samples by HealthKit type, such as heart_rate, heart_rate_variability, sleep_analysis, workouts, or body_mass. Requests read permission only for the required type.";
"按 HealthKit 数值类型读取统计结果，适合步数、活动能量、心率均值、HRV 均值等汇总查询。调用时仅请求所需类型的读取权限。" = "Reads statistics for HealthKit quantity types, useful for summaries such as step count, active energy, average heart rate, or average HRV. Requests read permission only for the required type.";
"写入允许记录的 HealthKit 数值样本，例如 heart_rate、dietary_water、dietary_caffeine、dietary_energy、body_mass。调用时仅请求该类型写入权限。" = "Écrit les échantillons quantitatifs HealthKit autorisés, tels que heart_rate, dietary_water, dietary_caffeine, dietary_energy ou body_mass. Demande uniquement l’autorisation d’écriture pour ce type.";
"写入一条包含收缩压、舒张压及可选心率的 HealthKit 血压记录。调用时请求相关类型写入权限。" = "Écrit une mesure de tension artérielle HealthKit contenant les pressions systolique et diastolique ainsi qu’une fréquence cardiaque facultative. Demande les autorisations d’écriture correspondantes lors de l’appel.";
"写入允许记录的 HealthKit 分类样本，例如 mindful_session、headache、fever、coughing。调用时仅请求该类型写入权限。" = "Writes allowed HealthKit category samples, such as mindful_session, headache, fever, or coughing. Requests write permission only for that type.";
"查询指定时间段内的系统日历事件，包含标题、地点、起止时间、备注和参与人摘要。调用时请求日历完整访问权限。" = "Queries system calendar events in a time range, including title, location, start/end time, notes, and attendee summary. Requests full calendar access when called.";
"创建系统日历事件，可设置地点、备注、提醒和简单循环规则。iOS 可写，watchOS 返回不支持。" = "Creates system calendar events with optional location, notes, alarms, and simple recurrence. Writable on iOS; watchOS returns unsupported.";
"更新已有系统日历事件。iOS 可写，watchOS 返回不支持。" = "Updates an existing system calendar event. Writable on iOS; watchOS returns unsupported.";
"删除已有系统日历事件。iOS 可写，watchOS 返回不支持。" = "Deletes an existing system calendar event. Writable on iOS; watchOS returns unsupported.";
"查询系统提醒事项，可按列表、完成状态和截止时间过滤。调用时请求提醒事项完整访问权限。" = "Queries system reminders and filters by list, completion state, or due date. Requests full reminders access when called.";
"创建系统提醒事项，可设置截止时间、优先级、时间提醒或位置提醒。iOS 可写，watchOS 返回不支持。" = "Creates system reminders with optional due date, priority, time alarm, or location alert. Writable on iOS; watchOS returns unsupported.";
"更新已有系统提醒事项，可修改完成状态、截止时间、优先级和提醒。iOS 可写，watchOS 返回不支持。" = "Updates an existing system reminder, including completion state, due date, priority, and alarms. Writable on iOS; watchOS returns unsupported.";
"删除已有系统提醒事项。iOS 可写，watchOS 返回不支持。" = "Deletes an existing system reminder. Writable on iOS; watchOS returns unsupported.";
"HealthKit 类型名，可先调用 health.list_types 查看。" = "HealthKit type name. Call health.list_types first to inspect available types.";
