"仅 Agent 模式可执行 scripts/；Skill 只读，工作区可写。" = "scripts/ can run only in Agent mode. The Skill is read-only and the workspace is writable.";
"仅 scripts/ 内文件可在 Agent 模式的本地 Linux 中执行；Skill 目录只读，当前工作区可写。" = "Only files inside scripts/ can run in Agent mode's local Linux. The Skill directory is read-only and the current workspace is writable.";
"使用 action=read_resource 和对应 path 读取可读资源；文本文件原样读取，docx/pptx/xlsx 与支持平台上的 PDF 会抽取纯文本；大文件可额外提供 start_line 与 max_lines 分块读取。scripts/ 源码可读取；只有 execute_script 会在授权后执行。" = "Use action=read_resource with path to read resources. Text is returned as-is; docx/pptx/xlsx and PDF on supported platforms are extracted as plain text. Large files also accept start_line and max_lines. Source in scripts/ is readable; only execute_script runs it after approval.";
"保存 Skill 执行策略失败。" = "Impossible d’enregistrer la politique d’exécution du Skill.";
"允许当前版本" = "Autoriser la version actuelle";
